  "description": "Central Plains Fur Con was a hotel-based furry convention held in Wichita, Kansas, organized by Merkindesr and Dale Fox. It grew out of the Central Plains Fur Meet, a camping trip first held in 2010 at Cheney Lake and moved to Lake Afton, whose rising attendance led the organizers to create a downtown Wichita convention. Three editions were held, in 2013, 2014 and 2015, at the Drury Plaza Hotel Broadview.",
